  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Knowledge (nature) 7 ranks or Linguistics 7 ranks, Communication sphere.</p>\n<p>You can communicate with any plant or fungus or ooze, even one that is not a creature, by forming a rapport with it as a standard action. When you form a rapport with a mindless target, you can spend 1 use of skill leverage to allow it to recall vague details about what has transpired within 30 feet of it during the previous 24 hours. If the target is normally immobile, you can spend another use of skill leverage to magically impart on it the ability to lean aside or grasp objects within reach equal to its height, which are released if you form a rapport with another immobile target. This is a supernatural effect.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/communication#toc58\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
